# __APP_TITLE__

A [Silth](https://silth.dev) application.

```bash
shards install
silth db:migrate
silth serve        # http://localhost:3000 — profiler at /_silth/profiler
```

- Tests: `silth test`
- Production build: `shards build --release` then `SILTH_ENV=production bin/cli assets:build`
- Docker: `docker build -t __APP_NAME__ .`
